# Keep the build context small and free of secrets. `**/` patterns match at
# any depth; the others only at the repository root.
#
# Shared by both Railway builds: Dockerfile.api (api service) AND the Nixpacks
# build of the web service, which also uses the repository root as its Docker
# context. Never exclude anything the web build reads (apps/web/** including
# public/, libs/**, root configs); CI checks every tracked apps/web and libs
# file is still in the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.nx
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/tmp
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
scripts
*.md
